If a clinician uses a methadone-treatment for an opioid-use-disorder then the clinician should not apply a pain-treatment-opioid-dosage-caution-threshold to the methadone-treatment.
If a clinician uses a buprenorphine-treatment for an opioid-use-disorder then the clinician should not apply a pain-treatment-opioid-dosage-caution-threshold to the buprenorphine-treatment.
